<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 5-yr, one bln mark Eurobond - minister.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 5-yr, one bln mark Eurobond - minister.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Turkish Treasury set a one billion mark, five-year Eurobond issue via lead managers Commerzbank and West Deutsche Landesbank, state minister Ufuk Soylemez said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;With this issue, the total Eurobond issues in the first six months of this year will reach $1.35 billion,&quot; Soylemez told Reuters.</p>
</text>
